@startuml j1-first-open
title J1 First open and the sample shop
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ParticipantFontColor #0B3D2E
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorFontColor #0B3D2E
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupHeaderFontColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
  DividerBorderColor #0E5C45
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  DividerFontColor #0B3D2E
  BoxBorderColor #0E5C45
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #0E5C45
  BackgroundColor #E8F2EE
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Owner" as O
participant "Home screen\n(index.html, app.js)" as H
participant "Layout\n(compact.js)" as L
database "Browser storage" as S
participant "Service worker\n(sw.js)" as W
autonumber
O -> H : open the live link
H -> S : read the saved theme, language and shop
S --> H : nothing saved yet: an empty shop, "My shop"
H --> O : "No customers yet." with the buttons\n"Add your first customer" and "Load sample shop"
H -> W : register the service worker once the page has loaded
O -> H : tap "Load sample shop"
H -> H : fetch sample-data.json from the site itself\n(sample.js is the copy used if that fails)
H -> S : save "Lakshmi Provision Store (fictional)"
H --> O : "Loaded Lakshmi Provision Store (fictional):\n8 customers, 38 entries." and "Shop loaded." with "Undo"
L --> O : "Total outstanding" with the strip "Customers", "Overdue",\n"Collected, last 30 days"; the customer list;\nthe quick entry pill with "+" at the bottom
L --> O : on a screen 1200 px wide or more: a right panel with\n"Record an entry", "Overdue" and "Recent entries"
O -> L : tap "…" in the strip
L --> O : the full overview: "Owes the most", "Collected, last 30 days",\n"Given on credit, last 30 days", "Longest without paying"
@enduml
